1
00:00:00,451 --> 00:00:02,451
(Sheldon:)It should take you
no more than three hours.

2
00:00:02,620 --> 00:00:05,500
Well, wait, how many questions
are on this thing?

3
00:00:05,664 --> 00:00:06,744
(Sheldon:)Only 211.

4
00:00:08,334 --> 00:00:12,584
Don't worry. I've kept them all
at a high-school graduate reading level.

5
00:00:14,298 --> 00:00:15,468
(Penny:)Thanks, pal.

6
00:00:15,633 --> 00:00:17,803
(Sheldon:)You got it, buddy.

7
00:00:19,303 --> 00:00:22,343
(Penny:)Sheldon, honey, did you ever consider
making friends by being...

8
00:00:22,515 --> 00:00:24,645
(Penny:)...I don't know, pleasant?

9
00:00:25,309 --> 00:00:27,899
(Sheldon:)Well, that's certainly
a thought-provoking hypothesis.

10
00:00:28,062 --> 00:00:31,402
(Sheldon:)May I suggest it
as the topic for your essay?

11
00:00:36,028 --> 00:00:40,328
Tsk, tsk, tsk.
Your questionnaire, very disappointing.

12
00:00:43,160 --> 00:00:45,040
(Leonard:)I answered every question, Sheldon.

13
00:00:45,204 --> 00:00:47,794
(Sheldon:)You answered the multiple choice
questions in a pattern.

14
00:00:47,957 --> 00:00:53,007
A-B-B-A-C, A-B-B-A-C.

15
00:00:54,672 --> 00:00:57,512
- Oh, you picked up on that, huh?
- Yeah, wait...

16
00:00:57,675 --> 00:00:58,715
(Sheldon:)How could I not?

